{"data": [{"author_id": "1001698027588018176", "created_at": "2026-11-03T21:14:28.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117727132294295974"], "id": "2117727132294295974", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 7, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "观身不净，特意说了“九孔常流不净” 。\n\n我初读这段的时候有很大的疑惑🤔，为什么身体要用“净”字呢？ 而且身体产生的污秽那是生命生来就自带的，为什么非要特指这具身体不净呢？\n\n既然身体不干净为什么不是观身不洁？ 可见重点在“净”字上。 https://t.co/U1ZEEYYURy", "url": "https://x.com/fan_yina/status/2117727132294295974"}, {"author_id": "1032081026338582528", "created_at": "2026-11-03T21:10:07.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117726037035663811"], "id": "2117726037035663811", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 10, "impression_count": 912, "like_count": 9, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 3}, "text": "学会找key level，是学好ICT的关键\n\nkey level不是简单的时段高低点\n\n不是简单的PDH/PDL，PWH/PWL\n\n而是你只需要一瞬间就能看见的\n明显的，碍眼的，突兀的，离谱的，干净的，奇怪的高低点\n\n这些点位才是key level\n\n时段高低点，PDH/PDL，PWH/PWL之所以重要，不是它本身重要", "url": "https://x.com/Keyshotvv/status/2117726037035663811"}], "includes": {"users": [{"id": "1001698027588018176", "name": "YINA.FAN", "username": "fan_yina"}, {"id": "1032081026338582528", "name": "Keyshotvv", "username": "Keyshotvv"}]}, "meta": {"newest_id": "2117727132294295974", "next_token": "b26v89c19zqg8o3juzlyijzgdzbnj5culxcq5stiodp4t", "oldest_id": "2117726037035663811", "result_count": 2}}
